WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:33.050
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:33.320 --> 01:36.600
What exactly did you hear on that call?

3
01:38.240 --> 01:41.720
I heard Daqing say intermittently on the phone

4
01:42.240 --> 01:43.900
that Fu Xiaochen stole money.

5
01:44.280 --> 01:45.539
Then it got very noisy,

6
01:45.680 --> 01:47.210
and they started fighting.

7
01:48.320 --> 01:49.440
I didn't expect

8
01:50.720 --> 01:51.960
Daqing to...

9
01:54.720 --> 01:56.380
When the police came to ask me,

10
01:57.080 --> 01:59.000
I was too scared,

11
02:00.240 --> 02:01.640
so I didn't say anything.

12
02:02.920 --> 02:03.880
I admit

13
02:05.040 --> 02:07.100
I was afraid of getting into trouble.

14
02:07.680 --> 02:09.520
I let Daqing down.

15
02:11.600 --> 02:12.400
I'm sorry.

16
02:14.120 --> 02:14.960
Get up.

17
02:16.120 --> 02:19.720
Deqing said his sister has been taking care of the family,

18
02:20.400 --> 02:24.040
which kept you from getting married all these years.

19
02:24.960 --> 02:26.960
He saved up a dowry for you,

20
02:27.520 --> 02:29.440
so you can marry if you want to in the future,

21
02:29.440 --> 02:31.770
or have money for retirement if you don't.

22
02:33.640 --> 02:34.440
My brother...

23
02:35.000 --> 02:36.920
Did my brother really say that?

24
02:49.360 --> 02:50.200
Now do you know

25
02:50.200 --> 02:52.460
what kind of person your Uncle Daqing is?

26
02:53.880 --> 02:56.240
You shouldn't have issued that letter of forgiveness.

27
02:56.240 --> 02:56.840
Brother Jun.

28
02:56.840 --> 02:59.840
Hasn't Sister Long been investigating the truth too?

29
03:00.880 --> 03:03.140
Don't you want to give me an explanation?

30
03:10.800 --> 03:11.660
Leaving again.

31
03:11.880 --> 03:13.240
Leaving without saying a word.

32
03:13.240 --> 03:13.970
Brother Jun.

33
03:16.320 --> 03:17.120
Godfather.

34
03:19.640 --> 03:21.280
Let's find a place to chat.

35
03:22.600 --> 03:22.880
Let's go.

36
03:22.880 --> 03:23.680
Wait a minute.

37
03:24.600 --> 03:27.400
I also have something to talk to Brother Jun about.

38
03:28.040 --> 03:29.770
Let's talk together. Let's go.

39
03:33.880 --> 03:34.940
Come, Brother Jun.

40
03:39.480 --> 03:40.920
I don't drink, thanks.

41
03:42.680 --> 03:44.480
Why is this guy so weird?

42
03:44.480 --> 03:45.600
Why did you come if you don't drink?

43
03:45.600 --> 03:46.520
Are you a man?

44
03:46.520 --> 03:48.040
Is there a causal relationship between the two?

45
03:48.040 --> 03:49.760
Besides, didn't you want to tag along?

46
03:49.760 --> 03:50.960
What do you mean I wanted to tag along?

47
03:50.960 --> 03:52.920
I... I have things to do too.

48
03:53.079 --> 03:54.480
You two saw it, right?

49
03:55.000 --> 03:58.280
Xiaolong has always been prejudiced against Uncle Daqing.

50
03:58.280 --> 03:59.640
Look at her going to the site today.

51
03:59.640 --> 04:01.000
Now she knows what's going on, right?

52
04:01.000 --> 04:03.060
I asked her, and she didn't say a word.

53
04:03.200 --> 04:03.760
Godfather.

54
04:03.760 --> 04:05.800
Brother Jun, I have the most say in this.

55
04:05.800 --> 04:08.160
Why? Because I followed the whole process.

56
04:08.160 --> 04:09.640
Long'er is not that kind of person,

57
04:09.640 --> 04:10.440
you know?

58
04:10.440 --> 04:11.360
She's just stubborn.

59
04:11.360 --> 04:12.220
How about this?

60
04:12.280 --> 04:14.360
Well, it's her fault for making you angry.

61
04:14.360 --> 04:15.680
Can I apologize to you on her behalf?

62
04:15.680 --> 04:17.079
Why should you apologize for her?

63
04:17.079 --> 04:18.120
Do you even know her?

64
04:18.120 --> 04:19.450
How could I not know her?

65
04:19.760 --> 04:21.680
We spend every day together at the law firm.

66
04:21.680 --> 04:22.520
I call her Long'er,

67
04:22.520 --> 04:23.480
and she calls me Hu'er.

68
04:23.480 --> 04:24.640
I even know exactly how many moles

69
04:24.640 --> 04:25.640
she has on her face.

70
04:25.640 --> 04:26.640
A fierce battle between a dragon and a tiger, huh?

71
04:26.640 --> 04:28.320
More like a dragon and a phoenix bringing prosperity.

72
04:28.320 --> 04:29.180
Let me tell you,

73
04:29.320 --> 04:30.800
what you two have is at most

74
04:30.800 --> 04:32.600
just working together.

75
04:32.640 --> 04:34.360
Aren't you two colleagues too?

76
04:34.360 --> 04:35.440
And a former one at that.

77
04:35.440 --> 04:36.440
What makes you so special?

78
04:36.440 --> 04:37.440
I have over twenty years on you.

79
04:37.440 --> 04:38.320
Well, I've known my uncle

80
04:38.320 --> 04:39.520
for over twenty years too.

81
04:39.520 --> 04:40.159
What's the use?

82
04:40.159 --> 04:40.920
We don't have a good relationship.

83
04:40.920 --> 04:41.800
That's because you're unfilial.

84
04:41.800 --> 04:42.920
Me, unfilial?

85
04:42.920 --> 04:43.680
Go ask around.

86
04:43.680 --> 04:44.920
I'm the most filial in that area.

87
04:44.920 --> 04:47.650
What are you doing? Are you two just going to chat?

88
04:48.000 --> 04:49.080
Aren't you going to talk to me?

89
04:49.080 --> 04:50.360
Yes, yes, I want to talk to you.

90
04:50.360 --> 04:51.690
He keeps interrupting.

91
04:52.880 --> 04:53.920
Jun, here's the thing.

92
04:53.920 --> 04:54.760
As for Xiaolong,

93
04:54.760 --> 04:57.640
she really handled this poorly.

94
04:57.640 --> 04:59.680
But she is truly righteous,

95
05:00.440 --> 05:01.920
and very loyal.

96
05:02.320 --> 05:03.600
As for her looks,

97
05:05.880 --> 05:06.800
she's just average.

98
05:06.800 --> 05:07.730
What do you mean?

99
05:08.440 --> 05:09.840
Are you being sarcastic?

100
05:10.080 --> 05:11.040
No, it's up to you.

101
05:11.040 --> 05:12.440
Don't forget the solemn oath you swore.

102
05:12.440 --> 05:13.160
I'm warning you,

103
05:13.160 --> 05:14.480
stop thinking about it.

104
05:14.480 --> 05:15.640
No, I'm not.

105
05:15.760 --> 05:17.640
That's pretty wild, even swearing solemn oaths.

106
05:17.640 --> 05:18.200
No,

107
05:18.200 --> 05:19.680
this is a misunderstanding.

108
05:19.680 --> 05:22.080
Drink less. No one is taking you home today.

109
05:22.200 --> 05:23.730
I don't need you to carry me.

110
05:29.600 --> 05:31.800
I'll just stroll back. It's so close.

111
05:37.600 --> 05:39.080
Godfather, you didn't drink too much, did you?

112
05:39.080 --> 05:40.440
No, no.

113
05:44.920 --> 05:46.320
Do you know why Xiaolong

114
05:46.320 --> 05:50.000
has always been prejudiced against Zhao Deqing?

115
05:52.320 --> 05:54.650
I've known a little girl since I was young.

116
05:55.120 --> 05:56.000
She and her dad

117
05:56.640 --> 05:58.000
depended on each other.

118
05:58.760 --> 05:59.800
She always told me

119
05:59.880 --> 06:01.880
that her dad was just like

120
06:01.880 --> 06:04.440
a hero in a martial arts movie.

121
06:06.880 --> 06:10.640
So dashing and loyal.

122
06:12.360 --> 06:14.000
But in this hero's heart,

123
06:15.280 --> 06:17.080
there wasn't just his daughter,

124
06:18.680 --> 06:20.410
but also the martial arts world

125
06:21.480 --> 06:23.120
and a bunch of brothers.

126
06:25.680 --> 06:28.560
And often, for his brothers and the martial arts world,

127
06:28.560 --> 06:30.890
he would leave his daughter alone at home.

128
06:31.880 --> 06:35.920
While waiting for her father to come home,

129
06:38.320 --> 06:40.050
the little girl slowly grew up.

130
06:40.680 --> 06:43.000
One day, the hero told his daughter,

131
06:43.000 --> 06:43.800
"Daughter,

132
06:45.240 --> 06:47.560
from now on, I'm washing my hands of it all."

133
06:47.560 --> 06:48.640
I quit.

134
06:50.880 --> 06:54.740
But at the critical moment of his daughter's college entrance exams,

135
06:55.640 --> 06:57.120
he broke his promise once again.

136
06:57.120 --> 06:58.250
I'll be right there.

137
07:01.920 --> 07:03.320
So many things to do.

138
07:03.320 --> 07:05.360
I can't even eat in peace.

139
07:05.640 --> 07:06.560
All right. You eat.

140
07:06.560 --> 07:07.000
You go ahead and eat.

141
07:07.000 --> 07:08.120
I have to go out and take care of something.

142
07:08.120 --> 07:09.180
I'll be right back.

143
07:09.480 --> 07:10.880
Is it about Uncle Daqing again?

144
07:10.880 --> 07:12.320
No, it's not him.

145
07:12.320 --> 07:14.450
It's something else, business stuff.

146
07:14.520 --> 07:16.440
I'll go and sort it out in a few words.

147
07:16.440 --> 07:17.440
When you came out last time,

148
07:17.440 --> 07:18.770
what did you promise me?

149
07:30.200 --> 07:31.120
One hour.

150
07:31.800 --> 07:33.530
You must be back within an hour.

151
07:34.120 --> 07:36.800
Otherwise, I'll punish you by not letting you drink for three months.

152
07:36.800 --> 07:37.920
Fine, fine, fine.

153
07:37.920 --> 07:38.680
Okay.

154
07:40.240 --> 07:42.100
My daughter is so understanding.

155
07:43.880 --> 07:44.560
Let's go.

156
07:47.960 --> 07:48.560
Chief Li.

157
07:49.560 --> 07:51.560
Please help take care of that child.

158
07:56.480 --> 07:57.080
Anyway.

159
07:57.080 --> 07:58.800
Leave the dishes after you eat.

160
07:58.800 --> 08:00.120
I'll clean them up when I get back.

161
08:00.120 --> 08:01.650
Just focus on your studies.

162
08:03.240 --> 08:05.900
I'll be back soon. It'll only take a few minutes.

163
08:14.920 --> 08:17.520
But she still hasn't given up on saving her dad.

164
08:18.000 --> 08:18.680
Get out.

165
08:18.800 --> 08:20.480
Ma'am, I apologize on behalf of my dad.

166
08:20.480 --> 08:21.480
I'm begging you, please.

167
08:21.480 --> 08:23.320
Your dad and Zhao Deqing almost killed my brother.

168
08:23.320 --> 08:26.250
How dare you ask for a letter of forgiveness? Get out.

169
08:28.400 --> 08:30.330
After the court auctions the house

170
08:30.440 --> 08:32.880
and compensates the victims, we'll see how much is left.

171
08:32.880 --> 08:35.559
Then we can plan our next step, okay?

172
08:39.799 --> 08:41.000
Later, Xiaolong told me

173
08:41.000 --> 08:43.240
that she had to buy this house back.

174
08:44.240 --> 08:45.560
Because this home

175
08:46.760 --> 08:48.880
holds too many of your memories.

176
08:50.800 --> 08:52.640
So that year, when she won her first big case,

177
08:52.640 --> 08:53.840
the first thing she did

178
08:53.840 --> 08:56.640
was to quickly pay the down payment for this house.

179
08:57.320 --> 08:59.120
This has always been on her mind.

180
08:59.440 --> 09:00.570
She never forgot it.

181
09:02.000 --> 09:04.120
Xiaolong has the same personality as you.

182
09:04.120 --> 09:05.120
Whenever she encounters difficulties

183
09:05.120 --> 09:07.080
or obstacles, she won't say a word.

184
09:09.880 --> 09:11.610
But precisely because of this,

185
09:13.800 --> 09:15.860
this is the hurdle she can't get over.

186
09:47.240 --> 09:48.320
Get some rest.

187
10:33.040 --> 10:36.320
City Intermediate Court, Tuesday at 10:00 a.m.

188
10:50.680 --> 10:51.880
Investigation reveals that

189
10:51.880 --> 10:55.280
the suspect, Fu Xiaochen, owed gambling debts

190
10:55.520 --> 10:58.800
and demanded money from the victim, Zhao Deqing,

191
10:59.040 --> 11:00.240
leading to a conflict

192
11:00.440 --> 11:03.170
that ultimately resulted in the victim's death.

193
11:03.320 --> 11:06.720
Zhao Deqing's civil representative, Attorney Xiao Longnv,

194
11:06.880 --> 11:10.680
also provided the testimony of a supporting witness, Zheng Xiaohong,

195
11:10.680 --> 11:12.240
compensating for the lack of audio

196
11:12.240 --> 11:14.120
in the surveillance footage at the time of the incident,

197
11:14.120 --> 11:16.360
fully reconstructing the crime.

198
11:16.760 --> 11:20.600
We now ask the court to play the surveillance video

199
11:20.880 --> 11:23.140
from the store on the day of the incident.

200
11:25.560 --> 11:28.240
On the day of the incident, Zhao Deqing was in the shop,

201
11:28.240 --> 11:31.170
talking on the phone with his friend Zheng Xiaohong.

202
11:32.240 --> 11:33.600
It must have tripped.

203
11:33.600 --> 11:36.460
The power zone is overloaded. Just flip the switch.

204
11:37.960 --> 11:39.490
Come have some watermelon.

205
11:40.240 --> 11:40.880
Right.

206
11:41.440 --> 11:44.040
If you use the electric kettle and induction cooker

207
11:44.040 --> 11:45.600
at the same time, plus the summer heat,

208
11:45.600 --> 11:46.360
it trips.

209
11:46.480 --> 11:47.940
This happens all the time.

210
11:48.440 --> 11:50.600
The power cords and stuff are too old.

211
11:52.880 --> 11:55.680
Is the kid's cold getting better? Still coughing?

212
11:56.680 --> 11:57.240
Okay.

213
11:58.000 --> 11:59.600
I'll go over there tomorrow.

214
12:02.480 --> 12:03.280
Wait a minute.

215
12:04.960 --> 12:06.160
What's wrong, Uncle?

216
12:10.720 --> 12:12.920
Did you take money from the shop? Take it out.

217
12:12.920 --> 12:15.400
Uncle, it's an emergency.

218
12:15.680 --> 12:17.680
I'll definitely pay you back later.

219
12:18.800 --> 12:20.200
You went gambling again.

220
12:20.240 --> 12:21.440
This is the last time.

221
12:21.440 --> 12:22.080
I...

222
12:22.280 --> 12:23.960
I'm afraid they'll go to my parents.

223
12:23.960 --> 12:25.320
Let's go. You're coming with me to the police station.

224
12:25.320 --> 12:27.920
Uncle, I can't go to the police station. Uncle.

225
12:27.920 --> 12:28.450
Let's go.

226
12:28.520 --> 12:29.280
You said it yourself.

227
12:29.280 --> 12:30.400
One more time and you'll go to the police station with me.

228
12:30.400 --> 12:31.080
If I don't pay them back,

229
12:31.080 --> 12:32.920
they'll beat me to death, Uncle.

230
12:33.200 --> 12:34.040
Uncle.

231
12:34.240 --> 12:35.080
Uncle, let's go.

232
12:35.080 --> 12:36.640
This is the last time, Uncle.

233
12:36.640 --> 12:38.560
You've told me this a thousand times.

234
12:38.560 --> 12:39.680
When did it ever count? Uncle.

235
12:39.680 --> 12:40.210
Let's go.

236
12:40.360 --> 12:41.440
This is the last time.

237
12:41.440 --> 12:42.880
I'll work like a horse to pay you back.

238
12:42.880 --> 12:44.240
Uncle, I beg you.

239
12:44.520 --> 12:45.080
Stand up.

240
12:45.080 --> 12:45.760
Uncle.

241
12:46.000 --> 12:47.320
I beg you. Get up.

242
12:54.000 --> 12:55.600
You're pulling a knife on me?

243
12:58.480 --> 12:59.540
You're pulling...

244
13:00.400 --> 13:01.860
Pulling a knife on me, huh?

245
13:02.120 --> 13:02.560
Put...

246
13:02.960 --> 13:04.040
Put it down.

247
13:27.000 --> 13:27.320
Uncle.

248
13:27.320 --> 13:27.850
Let's go.

249
13:29.000 --> 13:29.600
Let's go.

250
13:29.960 --> 13:30.560
Let's go.

251
13:52.240 --> 13:54.360
Fu Xiaochen, do you plead guilty?

252
13:59.800 --> 14:01.240
Your Honor.

253
14:01.560 --> 14:03.360
My client suffers from mental illness

254
14:03.360 --> 14:04.840
and may not be able to answer normally.

255
14:04.840 --> 14:05.600
Your Honor.

256
14:05.680 --> 14:07.640
Fu Xiaochen has no history of mental illness.

257
14:07.640 --> 14:08.720
In the detention center,

258
14:08.720 --> 14:11.360
he showed no signs of mental abnormality.

259
14:11.600 --> 14:14.720
If the defense attempts to fabricate facts,

260
14:14.920 --> 14:17.580
we will also prosecute you according to the law.

261
14:18.240 --> 14:20.840
Then I will reserve the right to have my client

262
14:21.160 --> 14:22.960
undergo a psychiatric evaluation in the future.

263
14:22.960 --> 14:24.240
I still hope the court

264
14:24.360 --> 14:26.200
will accept my defense

265
14:26.520 --> 14:28.180
and find my client not guilty,

266
14:28.240 --> 14:30.570
exempting him from criminal punishment.

267
14:30.840 --> 14:32.200
All rise.

268
14:34.800 --> 14:35.840
This court finds that

269
14:35.840 --> 14:36.560
after being brought to justice,

270
14:36.560 --> 14:39.440
the defendant, Fu Xiaochen, has shown

271
14:39.600 --> 14:41.280
no remorse for his criminal acts,

272
14:41.280 --> 14:42.840
nor has he made any compensation or apology

273
14:42.840 --> 14:44.760
to the victim's family.

274
14:45.120 --> 14:48.440
There are no circumstances for a mitigated or lighter punishment.

275
14:48.440 --> 14:51.560
According to the Criminal Law of the People's Republic of China,

276
14:51.560 --> 14:53.240
Article 264,

277
14:53.320 --> 14:56.480
and Paragraph 2 of Article 234,

278
14:56.720 --> 14:58.250
the judgment is as follows:

279
14:59.000 --> 15:00.600
The defendant, Fu Xiaochen,

280
15:00.840 --> 15:02.720
is guilty of intentional injury

281
15:03.000 --> 15:04.130
resulting in death,

282
15:04.480 --> 15:05.840
and guilty of theft.

283
15:06.240 --> 15:07.600
Combining the punishments for multiple crimes,

284
15:07.600 --> 15:09.840
he is sentenced to life imprisonment,

285
15:10.080 --> 15:12.400
and deprived of political rights for life.

286
15:12.400 --> 15:13.920
The court is now adjourned.

287
15:13.920 --> 15:16.560
Bailiffs, please take the defendant out of the courtroom.

288
15:16.560 --> 15:17.320
Xiaochen!

289
15:18.440 --> 15:19.000
Son!

290
15:19.440 --> 15:20.480
Xiaochen! Mom!

291
15:20.880 --> 15:22.560
Didn't you say it was justifiable defense?

292
15:22.560 --> 15:24.690
Why is he sentenced again, and to life?

293
15:25.760 --> 15:26.620
Attorney Qian,

294
15:26.880 --> 15:28.360
what's going on?

295
15:30.440 --> 15:31.120
Mom!

296
15:31.120 --> 15:32.080
Son!

297
15:32.720 --> 15:33.160
Son!

298
15:33.160 --> 15:34.680
Xiaochen!

299
15:34.720 --> 15:35.600
Son!

300
15:39.200 --> 15:39.880
Mom!

301
15:40.920 --> 15:42.580
Take good care of yourselves.

302
15:44.240 --> 15:45.000
Xiaochen!

303
15:45.200 --> 15:45.720
Son!

304
15:53.720 --> 15:54.200
Ms. Zhao.

305
15:54.200 --> 15:55.720
This bankbook has been kept as evidence.

306
15:55.720 --> 15:57.320
Now, it's being returned to you.

307
15:57.320 --> 15:58.200
Thank you.

308
15:59.600 --> 16:00.440
Take it.

309
16:00.600 --> 16:03.600
This was the money Uncle Daqing saved for the family.

310
16:07.360 --> 16:08.360
You know,

311
16:08.800 --> 16:10.520
I used to blame him.

312
16:13.360 --> 16:15.090
I blamed him for not being good.

313
16:15.840 --> 16:18.500
I blamed him for embarrassing our whole family.

314
16:19.000 --> 16:19.720
I even blamed him

315
16:19.720 --> 16:22.560
for not seeing my mom one last time.

316
16:27.120 --> 16:28.240
You know, if I had

317
16:28.880 --> 16:31.360
let you come home earlier,

318
16:33.200 --> 16:35.560
would you still be alive?

319
16:48.080 --> 16:48.840
It's her!

320
16:49.560 --> 16:51.200
She found some witness,

321
16:51.200 --> 16:53.800
and that's why Xiaochen got such a heavy sentence!

322
16:53.800 --> 16:55.360
Why did you harm my son?

323
16:55.360 --> 16:55.720
It's her!

324
16:55.720 --> 16:57.000
Why did you harm my son?

325
17:00.600 --> 17:02.130
Sister Long, get in the car!

326
17:03.480 --> 17:04.480
You harmed my son!

327
17:10.960 --> 17:11.599
What are you doing?

328
17:11.599 --> 17:12.329
Stop the car!

329
17:14.560 --> 17:16.089
What are you doing, sister?

330
17:19.560 --> 17:20.880
Alright, stop chasing.

331
17:20.880 --> 17:22.599
I happen to have something to say to you.

332
17:22.599 --> 17:24.359
How dare you say that!

333
17:24.480 --> 17:25.839
Take a break, sir.

334
17:25.839 --> 17:27.440
You trusted that Lawyer Qian,

335
17:27.440 --> 17:29.200
and he ruined Fu Xiaochen, you know?

336
17:29.200 --> 17:31.460
The evidence in this case is conclusive.

337
17:31.560 --> 17:33.520
Even without Zheng Xiaohong's testimony,

338
17:33.520 --> 17:35.560
Fu Xiaochen wouldn't have gotten a light sentence.

339
17:35.560 --> 17:37.800
You insisted on listening to Lawyer Qian's nonsense,

340
17:37.800 --> 17:39.520
talking about justifiable defense,

341
17:39.520 --> 17:40.520
sticking to it to the end,

342
17:40.520 --> 17:42.200
and even bringing up mental illness.

343
17:42.200 --> 17:43.680
What does this look like to the judge?

344
17:43.680 --> 17:46.080
A bad attitude towards pleading guilty will only lead to a heavier sentence.

345
17:46.080 --> 17:47.360
No, Lawyer Qian said

346
17:47.840 --> 17:49.240
he's been in this line of work for decades,

347
17:49.240 --> 17:50.200
and he's very experienced.

348
17:50.200 --> 17:51.360
Is he ginseng?

349
17:51.360 --> 17:52.960
The older he gets, the more valuable he is?

350
17:52.960 --> 17:54.520
He just took advantage of your mentality

351
17:54.520 --> 17:55.640
and scammed you.

352
17:55.720 --> 17:56.920
Yes, Uncle Fu.

353
17:57.240 --> 17:59.160
When his generation of lawyers entered the profession,

354
17:59.160 --> 18:01.120
there wasn't even a professional qualification exam.

355
18:01.120 --> 18:02.640
He doesn't even understand the law.

356
18:02.640 --> 18:03.120
In the Criminal Law of the People's Republic of China,

357
18:03.120 --> 18:04.280
there is no provision stating that

358
18:04.280 --> 18:06.680
mentally ill people don't have to bear legal consequences for breaking the law.

359
18:06.680 --> 18:09.040
Then, what about my Xiaochen?

360
18:09.520 --> 18:10.880
What should we do?

361
18:11.120 --> 18:13.520
If Xiaochen sincerely repents inside

362
18:13.520 --> 18:14.520
and behaves well,

363
18:14.800 --> 18:17.530
he still has a chance to get his sentence reduced.

364
18:19.040 --> 18:19.800
Actually,

365
18:21.960 --> 18:23.720
when Zhao Deqing was alive,

366
18:25.360 --> 18:28.290
he always wanted to guide Xiaochen on the right path.

367
18:40.680 --> 18:41.280
Sir,

368
18:41.760 --> 18:43.020
take a look at this car.

369
18:43.160 --> 18:44.520
What's wrong with the car?

370
18:44.520 --> 18:45.600
It won't start.

371
18:46.680 --> 18:47.600
It won't start?

372
18:49.560 --> 18:50.080
My god.

373
18:50.480 --> 18:51.520
What happened? Did you get into a fight

374
18:51.520 --> 18:52.520
and get beaten up?

375
18:53.040 --> 18:54.800
The car won't start.

376
19:02.840 --> 19:03.440
Come here.

377
19:04.880 --> 19:05.640
What are you doing?

378
19:05.640 --> 19:06.900
I need to disinfect it.

379
19:08.680 --> 19:09.880
Are you crazy?

380
19:10.240 --> 19:12.040
You need to be disinfected.

381
19:12.480 --> 19:13.600
You're so young.

382
19:13.720 --> 19:15.200
Why don't you walk the right path instead of fighting?

383
19:15.200 --> 19:16.660
Honest work pays too slow.

384
19:16.920 --> 19:18.200
Why are some people born rich

385
19:18.200 --> 19:19.730
while I have to work so hard?

386
19:20.840 --> 19:22.400
So you have to accept your fate.

387
19:22.400 --> 19:23.360
I won't accept my fate.

388
19:23.360 --> 19:25.020
If you won't accept your fate,

389
19:25.600 --> 19:27.600
you have to learn to be a good person.

390
19:27.800 --> 19:30.060
You don't look like a good person either.

391
19:31.320 --> 19:34.120
That's why you shouldn't learn from me.

392
19:37.680 --> 19:38.680
What's your name?

393
19:39.840 --> 19:41.100
My name is Fu Xiaochen.

394
19:41.840 --> 19:42.970
What about you, sir?

395
19:44.360 --> 19:45.620
My name is Zhao Deqing.

396
19:46.520 --> 19:48.760
How about you learn car repair from me?

397
20:00.800 --> 20:01.660
Attorney Xiao.

398
20:03.840 --> 20:04.840
I'm sorry.

399
20:05.040 --> 20:07.300
Uncle, you don't need to apologize to me.

400
20:07.600 --> 20:09.680
You should hold the right person accountable.

401
20:09.680 --> 20:11.960
You should go to Attorney Qian for a refund.

402
20:11.960 --> 20:13.080
Take responsibility where it's due.

403
20:13.080 --> 20:14.160
If he refuses to refund,

404
20:14.160 --> 20:16.360
you can report him to the Bar Association.

405
20:16.360 --> 20:17.280
That bastard is over there,

406
20:17.280 --> 20:18.480
that Huoyun Xieshen.

407
20:19.600 --> 20:21.160
You bastard!

408
20:21.400 --> 20:23.520
Stop! Stop!

409
20:24.400 --> 20:27.120
Stop! Stop! Stop!

410
20:27.400 --> 20:29.800
Stop!

411
20:30.480 --> 20:31.000
Stop!

412
20:44.160 --> 20:44.920
Dad.

413
21:06.520 --> 21:08.160
I'm telling you about Daqing.

414
21:08.160 --> 21:09.960
That little brat was sentenced.

415
21:10.600 --> 21:12.060
He got life imprisonment.

416
21:13.680 --> 21:15.160
My... my thought is

417
21:15.160 --> 21:16.820
he must get the death penalty.

418
21:17.840 --> 21:19.160
Even shooting him eight times

419
21:19.160 --> 21:21.690
and tearing him to pieces wouldn't be enough.

420
21:21.840 --> 21:23.700
Then I thought... I thought about

421
21:23.840 --> 21:25.770
when you... when you were alive...

422
21:26.480 --> 21:29.920
You've done so many good deeds.

423
21:30.240 --> 21:33.040
Especially since you helped that little brat,

424
21:33.200 --> 21:34.530
and treated him so well.

425
21:35.520 --> 21:38.840
You wouldn't want to see him die either.

426
21:41.760 --> 21:43.290
Then let him live in regret.

427
21:44.480 --> 21:46.480
That's the best punishment for him.

428
21:46.720 --> 21:49.000
That should be what you want to see too.

429
21:52.680 --> 21:53.000
Really.

430
21:53.000 --> 21:54.600
This time, your niece,

431
21:54.600 --> 21:55.360
Xiaolong,

432
21:55.800 --> 21:57.040
for your case,

433
21:58.040 --> 21:59.320
she tried her best

434
21:59.600 --> 22:00.880
because she wanted to get Deyan

435
22:00.880 --> 22:01.810
a bit more money.

436
22:02.720 --> 22:03.440
Up there in heaven,

437
22:03.440 --> 22:04.480
if you have the power,

438
22:04.480 --> 22:06.400
please bless your niece.

439
22:06.440 --> 22:08.080
Let everything go smoothly for her,

440
22:08.080 --> 22:09.000
keep her healthy,

441
22:09.000 --> 22:10.680
and free from any illness.

442
22:11.480 --> 22:12.320
This child,

443
22:16.080 --> 22:17.880
she's just unlucky

444
22:19.040 --> 22:20.840
to have a father like me.

445
22:23.080 --> 22:24.520
I really have no ability.

446
22:24.520 --> 22:25.320
I can't help her,

447
22:25.320 --> 22:26.520
nor can I support her.

448
22:26.960 --> 22:28.600
I've been locked up inside all this time,

449
22:28.600 --> 22:29.800
staying in prison.

450
22:29.800 --> 22:31.060
And then her mother...

451
22:32.520 --> 22:33.850
Let's not talk about it.

452
22:35.040 --> 22:36.640
Leaving the child all alone.

453
22:41.160 --> 22:44.400
Unlike other parents who can accompany their children,

454
22:44.760 --> 22:46.560
accompany them to school,

455
22:47.640 --> 22:49.300
and help them find a job later.

456
22:49.520 --> 22:51.280
All the grievances she suffered growing up,

457
22:51.280 --> 22:52.800
she never complained once,

458
22:52.800 --> 22:54.530
just bearing it all by herself.

459
22:54.880 --> 22:55.640
In the past, I thought

460
22:55.640 --> 22:57.520
I knew my daughter pretty well.

461
22:57.520 --> 22:58.320
But actually,

462
23:00.920 --> 23:02.180
I don't know her at all.

463
23:09.080 --> 23:11.040
I really owe her too much.

464
23:13.640 --> 23:14.520
Too much.

465
23:17.520 --> 23:18.160
Too much.

466
23:27.320 --> 23:28.000
Who is it?

467
23:31.160 --> 23:32.400
It's Dad. What's going on?

468
23:32.400 --> 23:33.360
Why are you here?

469
23:33.520 --> 23:35.120
Wait, why did you come over?

470
23:38.040 --> 23:39.080
I was just walking by,

471
23:39.080 --> 23:42.360
and I saw the light was on.

472
23:42.360 --> 23:43.480
I was wondering who it was.

473
23:43.480 --> 23:44.410
You startled me.

474
23:44.760 --> 23:45.320
Yeah.

475
23:45.480 --> 23:46.600
Come in, quick.

476
23:46.640 --> 23:47.880
Xiaolong, sit here. I've been sitting for a while.

477
23:47.880 --> 23:49.320
No, hurry up.

478
23:49.320 --> 23:50.980
Come here, it's comfortable.

479
23:53.760 --> 23:56.280
What's up, Brother Jun? Drinking alone?

480
23:56.480 --> 23:57.280
You should have told me earlier.

481
23:57.280 --> 24:00.210
Wouldn't it be better to go home and make some dishes?

482
24:00.240 --> 24:01.840
Come on, I'll drink with you.

483
24:01.920 --> 24:03.380
Is that all you're having?

484
24:08.440 --> 24:09.760
This is pretty strong.

485
24:10.000 --> 24:11.080
Uncle Daqing

486
24:11.280 --> 24:13.080
would pass out after one sip.

487
24:13.320 --> 24:14.880
He can't hold his liquor.

488
24:15.800 --> 24:17.720
There's something I don't understand.

489
24:17.720 --> 24:18.200
What is it?

490
24:18.200 --> 24:18.880
Among all the brothers,

491
24:18.880 --> 24:20.800
you're closest to Uncle Daqing, right?

492
24:20.800 --> 24:21.360
Right?

493
24:21.720 --> 24:22.480
Then why

494
24:22.720 --> 24:24.280
isn't he one of

495
24:24.280 --> 24:25.810
the Eight Great Guardians?

496
24:26.080 --> 24:27.480
He wasn't given the title?

497
24:27.480 --> 24:28.480
He joined later.

498
24:28.640 --> 24:29.840
Nine Great Guardians sounds good too.

499
24:29.840 --> 24:31.120
Xiaolong, it's not what you think.

500
24:31.120 --> 24:33.120
The Eight Great Guardians is a title in the martial world.

501
24:33.120 --> 24:34.000
It can't be changed?

502
24:34.000 --> 24:34.440
You have to...

503
24:34.440 --> 24:36.160
For example, the Four Heavenly Kings of Hong Kong.

504
24:36.160 --> 24:37.080
If they announced the Five Heavenly Kings,

505
24:37.080 --> 24:38.480
wouldn't that be ridiculous?

506
24:38.480 --> 24:41.000
Please welcome Andy Lau from Hong Kong, China,

507
24:41.000 --> 24:41.840
Jacky Cheung,

508
24:41.920 --> 24:42.760
Leon Lai,

509
24:42.760 --> 24:43.420
Aaron Kwok,

510
24:44.080 --> 24:44.810
and Xiao Jun.

511
24:46.160 --> 24:46.920
I think it's great.

512
24:46.920 --> 24:48.980
You are the Heavenly King in my heart.

513
24:52.840 --> 24:53.400
Dad.

514
24:57.840 --> 24:58.640
What's wrong?

515
25:03.160 --> 25:03.840
Heartburn.

516
25:06.040 --> 25:08.100
Stop drinking if you have heartburn.

517
25:08.160 --> 25:11.290
It hasn't been easy for you in there these past few years.

518
25:17.480 --> 25:20.010
No, I think it hasn't been easy for you either.

519
25:20.800 --> 25:22.480
You've been through so much growing up.

520
25:22.480 --> 25:23.120
I completely...

521
25:23.120 --> 25:24.050
I completely...

522
25:24.360 --> 25:25.480
I was still...

523
25:26.040 --> 25:27.640
I was still there with you...

524
25:40.400 --> 25:41.360
All right.

525
25:41.600 --> 25:42.920
Why are we both crying?

526
25:45.520 --> 25:47.600
Why are we crying like this here?

527
25:47.600 --> 25:48.160
Really.

528
25:48.160 --> 25:49.040
Exactly.

529
25:49.480 --> 25:52.520
Didn't you just say Xiao Jun of the Five Heavenly Kings?

530
25:52.520 --> 25:55.560
Well, how about the Heavenly King sings you a song?

531
25:58.640 --> 26:00.680
Once loved deeply.

532
26:01.800 --> 26:03.840
Once felt helpless.

533
26:04.760 --> 26:06.640
Once shed tears,

534
26:07.120 --> 26:08.840
reluctant to let go.

535
26:10.160 --> 26:11.840
Once was young.

536
26:12.880 --> 26:15.000
Once was impulsive.

537
26:15.920 --> 26:21.320
Once got drunk for you.

538
26:38.760 --> 26:40.200
Look at you.

539
26:40.200 --> 26:41.600
You look great.

540
26:41.760 --> 26:42.320
Brother.

541
26:43.120 --> 26:44.280
Your hair is all white.

542
26:44.280 --> 26:46.240
At my age, of course it's white.

543
26:56.640 --> 26:58.000
They are all waiting at the restaurant.

544
26:58.000 --> 26:59.120
Get in the car. I'll take you there. Come on.

545
26:59.120 --> 26:59.760
Brother.

546
27:01.760 --> 27:03.490
I plan to live a different life.

547
27:09.720 --> 27:10.560
Alright.

548
27:11.160 --> 27:12.400
Live a different life. Alright.

549
27:12.400 --> 27:13.930
I'm leaving then, brother.

550
27:32.240 --> 27:33.320
Come here, everyone.

551
27:33.320 --> 27:35.040
Let me introduce two new colleagues to you.

552
27:35.040 --> 27:36.170
Let's welcome them.

553
27:37.000 --> 27:38.400
Please introduce yourselves.

554
27:38.400 --> 27:40.080
Hello, everyone. My name is Lan Lingling.

555
27:40.080 --> 27:41.410
You can call me Xiao Lan.

556
27:41.600 --> 27:42.880
It's my first day working here.

557
27:42.880 --> 27:43.920
I hope to learn a lot from you all.

558
27:43.920 --> 27:44.520
Bowen.

559
27:44.520 --> 27:44.880
Chao.

560
27:45.440 --> 27:47.040
Lawyer Li is looking for you.

561
27:51.280 --> 27:52.740
This day has finally come.

562
27:53.840 --> 27:54.520
Come in.

563
27:55.280 --> 27:55.880
Lawyer Li.

564
27:56.240 --> 27:56.800
Sit down.

565
27:59.960 --> 28:00.620
Have a seat.

566
28:00.880 --> 28:02.480
I have something to tell you.

567
28:05.920 --> 28:06.520
Sit down.

568
28:06.520 --> 28:07.120
Lawyer Li.

569
28:07.400 --> 28:09.060
I want to say a few words first.

570
28:10.520 --> 28:12.080
I've been a chatterbox since I was a kid.

571
28:12.080 --> 28:13.160
My mom used to beat me for it.

572
28:13.160 --> 28:14.290
But I never changed.

573
28:14.320 --> 28:15.560
I also love a bit of gossip.

574
28:15.560 --> 28:16.280
When you were away,

575
28:16.280 --> 28:17.610
I sat in your chair once.

576
28:17.640 --> 28:18.920
But I really don't have any bad intentions.

577
28:18.920 --> 28:20.200
Since I joined the team,

578
28:20.200 --> 28:22.000
All I want is to handle cases every day.

579
28:22.000 --> 28:23.440
I just want the best for our team.

580
28:23.440 --> 28:25.570
And my phone is on silent every day now.

581
28:25.640 --> 28:27.280
I don't want to leave.

582
28:29.960 --> 28:30.600
Sit down.

583
28:37.920 --> 28:39.800
Who said you two could leave?

584
28:41.520 --> 28:44.160
No, we both know.

585
28:44.640 --> 28:45.840
We are the leftovers.

586
28:45.880 --> 28:47.440
We had a farewell dinner that day,

587
28:47.440 --> 28:50.320
and then so many new people came to the firm.

588
28:52.280 --> 28:53.080
I was wondering why you two

589
28:53.080 --> 28:54.200
have been showing off

590
28:54.200 --> 28:55.800
in front of me recently.

591
28:55.920 --> 28:58.320
I treated you to dinner to reward you

592
28:58.600 --> 29:00.200
for your hard work recently.

593
29:00.280 --> 29:01.960
Do you have so little confidence in yourselves,

594
29:01.960 --> 29:03.820
or do you have no confidence in me?

595
29:03.920 --> 29:04.800
We do.

596
29:05.120 --> 29:05.720
We have confidence.

597
29:05.720 --> 29:07.760
Anyway, I have a lot of confidence in myself.

598
29:07.760 --> 29:09.280
No matter who joins my team,

599
29:09.280 --> 29:10.320
I can lead them well.

600
29:10.320 --> 29:11.120
Of course.

601
29:11.600 --> 29:12.440
You two

602
29:12.480 --> 29:14.080
have saved me a lot of energy.

603
29:14.360 --> 29:16.560
So a good team doesn't depend on the number of people.

604
29:16.560 --> 29:18.890
I didn't plan to add any new people either.

605
29:18.920 --> 29:19.800
What did I tell you?

606
29:19.800 --> 29:21.280
I said we are the apples of his eye.

607
29:21.280 --> 29:22.240
You just overthink things.

608
29:22.240 --> 29:24.040
Didn't you tell me at dinner that day

609
29:24.040 --> 29:24.480
that...

610
29:24.480 --> 29:24.960
Come in.

611
29:26.320 --> 29:26.760
Mr. Li.

612
29:27.160 --> 29:29.220
A client specifically asked for you.

613
29:29.240 --> 29:31.840
No appointment, but insists on seeing you now.

614
29:32.920 --> 29:34.160
Did they say what the case is about?

615
29:34.160 --> 29:35.000
They didn't say anything,

616
29:35.000 --> 29:36.660
just that they want to see you.

617
29:42.320 --> 29:43.120
Son.

618
29:44.320 --> 29:45.040
Mom.

619
29:52.560 --> 29:53.040
Mom.

620
29:53.160 --> 29:54.320
You came back so suddenly

621
29:54.320 --> 29:55.200
without telling me.

622
29:55.200 --> 29:57.480
I could have at least picked you up at the airport.

623
29:57.480 --> 29:59.140
I just wanted to surprise you.

624
29:59.840 --> 30:00.560
A senior partner's

625
30:00.560 --> 30:01.560
office

626
30:01.560 --> 30:02.820
is indeed impressive.

627
30:02.960 --> 30:04.490
The view is really nice too.

628
30:05.000 --> 30:07.120
You came back so suddenly.

629
30:08.080 --> 30:09.760
Is something wrong?

630
30:09.960 --> 30:12.200
I just happened to have a few days off,

631
30:12.320 --> 30:13.680
and I missed you,

632
30:13.680 --> 30:15.920
so I came back to spend some time with you.

633
30:15.920 --> 30:16.400
Okay.

634
30:17.880 --> 30:20.240
If he's free today, let me treat your Director Wang to a meal.

635
30:20.240 --> 30:21.770
I want to thank him in person

636
30:21.800 --> 30:23.330
for taking good care of you.

637
30:23.560 --> 30:24.960
Our director is very busy.

638
30:24.960 --> 30:26.560
Even busy people have to eat.

639
30:28.000 --> 30:28.720
Ma'am,

640
30:29.960 --> 30:30.800
please have some tea.

641
30:30.800 --> 30:32.040
Thank you. Thanks.

642
30:32.040 --> 30:33.560
You're so sweet.

643
30:33.800 --> 30:35.720
Are you Xin's colleague?

644
30:35.720 --> 30:37.840
Yes, ma'am. I'm his mentee.

645
30:38.200 --> 30:39.360
Mom, Mom.

646
30:39.360 --> 30:40.560
We're working.

647
30:41.440 --> 30:42.520
Why don't you go home and wait for me?

648
30:42.520 --> 30:43.320
All right.

649
30:43.440 --> 30:44.800
I'll go home and wait for you then.

650
30:44.800 --> 30:46.200
Come back early.

651
30:46.320 --> 30:47.440
With your back injury,

652
30:47.440 --> 30:48.120
you shouldn't overwork yourself.

653
30:48.120 --> 30:48.920
Got it?

654
30:48.920 --> 30:49.800
Okay, I got it.

655
30:49.800 --> 30:50.720
I'll call a car for you.

656
30:50.720 --> 30:51.920
I can call one for her.

657
30:51.920 --> 30:52.760
You go ahead with your work.

658
30:52.760 --> 30:53.520
Ma'am, I'll walk you out.

659
30:53.520 --> 30:54.440
Okay.

660
30:55.000 --> 30:56.060
I'll head back now.

661
30:56.320 --> 30:57.800
Send me a WeChat when you get home.

662
30:57.800 --> 30:58.480
Okay.

663
30:58.560 --> 30:59.280
Hello, Ma'am.

664
30:59.280 --> 30:59.720
Hello.

665
30:59.720 --> 31:00.600
This way, Ma'am.

666
31:00.600 --> 31:01.360
Right this way.

667
31:01.360 --> 31:02.520
Ma'am, you look so young.

668
31:02.520 --> 31:03.520
I couldn't tell at all

669
31:03.520 --> 31:05.080
that you are Lawyer Li's mother.

670
31:05.080 --> 31:06.520
Standing next to him, you look like siblings.

671
31:06.520 --> 31:06.920
Yes.

672
31:06.920 --> 31:08.380
Look at how well you speak.

673
31:09.760 --> 31:12.360
Thank you guys for coming into the live stream.

674
31:12.600 --> 31:12.760
Yi***: Welcome, welcome. Leyang's new streamer makes a grand debut.

675
31:12.760 --> 31:13.520
What's this English name?

676
31:13.520 --> 31:14.280
I don't know it.

677
31:14.280 --> 31:15.810
This English word of yours,

678
31:16.280 --> 31:17.440
anyway, welcome.

679
31:17.720 --> 31:19.000
Welcome, these letters.

680
31:19.000 --> 31:19.920
This is my first time.

681
31:19.920 --> 31:21.440
My first time streaming.

682
31:21.440 --> 31:22.600
I'm Xiao Jun,

683
31:22.800 --> 31:24.520
one of the Eight Great Guardians of Leyang.

684
31:24.520 --> 31:26.200
Some of the older folks in Leyang

685
31:26.200 --> 31:27.600
might know me.

686
31:27.760 --> 31:29.320
A while ago,

687
31:30.080 --> 31:32.000
a really good brother of mine

688
31:32.280 --> 31:33.040
passed away.

689
31:33.280 --> 31:34.480
Passed away.

690
31:34.680 --> 31:36.520
And suddenly,

691
31:37.320 --> 31:38.440
I just understood.

692
31:38.440 --> 31:39.720
I said, while I'm still alive,

693
31:39.720 --> 31:41.360
I must leave myself

694
31:42.000 --> 31:43.120
a memorial.

695
31:43.600 --> 31:44.480
So I...

696
31:44.720 --> 31:45.400
Here comes another one.

697
31:45.400 --> 31:46.600
Welcome, Li Guochen.

698
31:46.920 --> 31:48.600
Li... Li Guochen.

699
31:53.200 --> 31:55.760
Speaking of Li Guochen,

700
31:55.760 --> 31:58.040
you have the same name as a cop I know.

701
32:01.040 --> 32:01.760
Where is Tietou?

702
32:01.760 --> 32:03.440
He did practice the Iron Head skill,

703
32:03.440 --> 32:05.520
but his master might be a charlatan.

704
32:05.800 --> 32:07.760
Every time he goes out to fight,

705
32:07.760 --> 32:08.520
this Tietou,

706
32:08.520 --> 32:09.800
his head definitely gets busted open.

707
32:09.800 --> 32:11.060
Morning, Sister Long.

708
32:11.280 --> 32:12.410
Morning, Director.

709
32:14.520 --> 32:15.520
You look comfortable.

710
32:15.520 --> 32:16.520
Found a new desk?

711
32:16.960 --> 32:18.120
Just to be closer to you.

712
32:18.120 --> 32:19.800
Why do you need to be close to me?

713
32:19.800 --> 32:22.520
Being closer to you means being closer to the AC.

714
32:22.880 --> 32:24.120
It's so hot outside.

715
32:24.320 --> 32:25.440
What are you watching?

716
32:25.440 --> 32:26.440
Following a star?

717
32:27.440 --> 32:28.440
Following my dad?

718
32:28.640 --> 32:30.040
He speaks so well.

719
32:30.280 --> 32:31.800
What? Are you changing careers?

720
32:31.800 --> 32:33.800
I was thinking your dad is gaining followers fast.

721
32:33.800 --> 32:35.240
He's about to become an influencer.

722
32:35.240 --> 32:37.500
I'll ask him to help promote our law firm.

723
32:38.000 --> 32:38.800
Come on.

724
32:39.280 --> 32:39.960
Turn it off.

725
32:39.960 --> 32:41.020
Someone's coming.

726
32:41.120 --> 32:41.960
A client?

727
32:42.520 --> 32:43.280
Come in.

728
32:44.840 --> 32:45.680
Hello, hello, hello.

729
32:45.680 --> 32:47.120
I'm the marketing manager of this law firm.

730
32:47.120 --> 32:48.580
What do you need advice on?

731
32:48.600 --> 32:49.000
I...

732
32:49.000 --> 32:50.800
You can ask anyone around here.

733
32:50.800 --> 32:52.960
Our Lawyer Xiao can handle any case.

734
32:52.960 --> 32:53.280
I know. I...

735
32:53.280 --> 32:54.000
The lawyer is inside.

736
32:54.000 --> 32:54.720
She'll be out in a minute.

737
32:54.720 --> 32:55.520
Jia'er.

738
32:56.520 --> 32:57.360
Coming.

739
32:57.520 --> 32:58.280
Sister Zhao.

740
32:58.840 --> 32:59.840
I hope I'm not interrupting your work.

741
32:59.840 --> 33:00.400
Not at all.

742
33:00.400 --> 33:01.640
Don't be so polite.

743
33:03.120 --> 33:05.040
Lawyer Xiao, would you do me the honor

744
33:05.040 --> 33:06.280
of having a meal with me?

745
33:06.280 --> 33:07.210
Sure, let's eat.

746
33:07.240 --> 33:09.080
But since you're on my turf, it's my treat.

747
33:09.080 --> 33:10.280
No, no, no. I arranged it,

748
33:10.280 --> 33:11.000
so it's my treat.

749
33:11.000 --> 33:11.720
Then you treat.

750
33:11.720 --> 33:12.450
You're rich.

751
33:13.240 --> 33:13.640
Let's go.

752
33:13.640 --> 33:14.680
Bye, Sister Zhao.

753
33:14.720 --> 33:15.480
What are we eating?

754
33:15.480 --> 33:16.240
You choose.

755
33:18.680 --> 33:19.760
What's up, Brother Hu?

756
33:19.760 --> 33:21.040
You thought it was a big client?

757
33:21.040 --> 33:22.720
That's Sister Long's high school classmate.

758
33:22.720 --> 33:23.840
What are you laughing at?

759
33:23.840 --> 33:24.800
This is my professional instinct

760
33:24.800 --> 33:26.440
as a marketing manager.

761
33:26.720 --> 33:27.520
I'm so sharp.

762
33:27.520 --> 33:28.920
I just reacted in a flash.

763
33:28.920 --> 33:30.440
Uncle, be a little modest.

764
33:30.720 --> 33:32.240
When Lawyer Li came last time,

765
33:32.240 --> 33:33.720
you also thought he was a big client.

766
33:33.720 --> 33:35.000
That was so awkward.

767
33:35.000 --> 33:36.720
Why bring it up if you know it's awkward?

768
33:36.720 --> 33:37.440
Mr. Wang,

769
33:37.440 --> 33:39.720
the proposal for the client is being revised.

770
33:39.720 --> 33:40.450
Don't worry.

771
33:41.320 --> 33:42.240
Wait a moment.

772
33:43.040 --> 33:45.520
Liu, send me the revised proposal ASAP.

773
33:45.800 --> 33:47.160
Check it a few times before sending.

774
33:47.160 --> 33:48.820
Don't make any more mistakes.

775
33:50.280 --> 33:53.360
That's why they say serious women are the most attractive.

776
33:53.360 --> 33:54.280
Not bad,

777
33:54.560 --> 33:55.600
Zhao.

778
33:56.120 --> 33:57.040
Got promoted.

779
33:57.280 --> 33:58.360
Got rich.

780
33:59.120 --> 34:00.520
I'm still just a corporate slave.

781
34:00.520 --> 34:01.600
Unlike you,

782
34:01.880 --> 34:04.120
running a law firm and being your own boss.

783
34:04.120 --> 34:05.050
So much freedom.

784
34:05.680 --> 34:06.200
I really wish

785
34:06.200 --> 34:08.120
I had financial freedom like you.

786
34:09.040 --> 34:09.600
Alright.

787
34:09.719 --> 34:12.920
You're so busy but still asked me out for a meal. What's up?

788
34:22.639 --> 34:25.120
Cheng Fei said he wants a divorce.

789
34:29.679 --> 34:30.340
Did you guys

790
34:32.760 --> 34:33.600
have a fight?

791
34:34.520 --> 34:35.480
No, we didn't.

792
34:35.760 --> 34:37.120
There were no signs.

793
34:37.800 --> 34:38.560
He just

794
34:39.400 --> 34:41.800
suddenly and calmly said

795
34:42.800 --> 34:44.000
we're incompatible.

796
34:44.120 --> 34:45.199
What do you mean incompatible?

797
34:45.199 --> 34:46.520
You've been fine for over ten years.

798
34:46.520 --> 34:48.650
How can you suddenly be incompatible?

799
34:50.719 --> 34:52.650
Has he been acting strange lately?

800
34:54.280 --> 34:56.520
I've been on business trips for the past six months.

801
34:56.520 --> 34:58.760
I haven't been home much.

802
34:58.880 --> 35:00.120
Even when I am home,

803
35:00.880 --> 35:02.940
I barely speak a few words to him a day.

804
35:04.360 --> 35:05.290
Acting strange?

805
35:06.280 --> 35:08.800
Could he be acting out to get your attention?

806
35:09.120 --> 35:09.960
Really?

807
35:10.000 --> 35:12.040
Rebelling against you in such an extreme way

808
35:12.040 --> 35:14.100
is just to get more of your attention.

809
35:14.320 --> 35:15.480
You've been together for over ten years.

810
35:15.480 --> 35:17.340
You can't just break up like that.

811
35:20.600 --> 35:21.520
Yeah.

812
35:25.880 --> 35:26.640
[Unlocked]

813
35:26.960 --> 35:28.280
Hi, Mom.

814
35:28.360 --> 35:30.120
Look what I made.

815
35:30.520 --> 35:31.880
It's a dinosaur.

816
35:32.040 --> 35:33.280
Yes, look.

817
35:33.720 --> 35:35.800
Jeffrey, your brother is here.

818
35:35.920 --> 35:37.120
Do you remember him?

819
35:38.520 --> 35:39.280
Hello.

820
35:39.920 --> 35:42.800
I miss you. When are you coming back?

821
35:42.800 --> 35:43.920
I miss you too.

822
35:44.120 --> 35:45.440
Be a good boy, okay?

823
35:45.560 --> 35:46.280
Okay.

824
35:46.360 --> 35:48.160
Alright, I'll talk to you later.

825
35:48.280 --> 35:49.080
Love you.

826
35:53.440 --> 35:54.080
Son.

827
35:54.600 --> 35:55.080
Well,

828
35:55.080 --> 35:56.000
have you eaten?

829
35:56.600 --> 35:57.360
I've eaten.

830
35:57.640 --> 35:58.280
Look.

831
35:58.480 --> 36:01.080
This is wild American ginseng I bought for you,

832
36:01.080 --> 36:02.920
and this is deer antler.

833
36:03.160 --> 36:04.920
They're both good for your health.

834
36:04.920 --> 36:06.360
Remember to take them.

835
36:06.760 --> 36:07.440
Mom,

836
36:07.800 --> 36:10.080
it's quite a hassle to carry these.

837
36:10.080 --> 36:11.610
You can buy them online now.

838
36:12.160 --> 36:13.000
Buying online

839
36:13.000 --> 36:15.730
isn't the same as me picking them out personally.

840
36:16.880 --> 36:19.120
This is a gift from Wilson.

841
36:19.160 --> 36:20.200
See if you like it.

842
36:22.200 --> 36:24.560
Mom, I don't drink.

843
36:25.160 --> 36:26.090
Thank him for me.

844
36:27.440 --> 36:28.880
This foreigner,

845
36:28.920 --> 36:30.480
I told him you don't drink,

846
36:30.480 --> 36:31.920
but he insisted on packing it.

847
36:31.920 --> 36:33.080
You see,

848
36:33.200 --> 36:34.860
it's the thought that counts.

849
36:35.280 --> 36:35.920
Then I...

850
36:37.080 --> 36:38.680
I have something to tell you.

851
36:41.480 --> 36:42.280
Son.

852
36:43.360 --> 36:44.080
Well,

853
36:45.480 --> 36:47.440
I want to discuss something with you.

854
36:47.440 --> 36:48.360
Go ahead.

855
36:50.120 --> 36:52.600
I want to apply for permanent residency.

856
36:52.600 --> 36:54.880
A business visa is inconvenient.

857
36:54.880 --> 36:58.040
Yeah, it's exhausting for you to travel back and forth.

858
36:58.640 --> 36:59.400
Just do it if you want.

859
36:59.400 --> 37:00.530
It's your decision.

860
37:00.560 --> 37:02.760
I'm mainly thinking about your future.

861
37:02.880 --> 37:03.320
You know,

862
37:03.320 --> 37:06.320
you can't stay in this small place forever, right?

863
37:07.080 --> 37:08.560
I also found you

864
37:08.560 --> 37:10.360
a really good rehab center.

865
37:10.360 --> 37:11.480
It's specially... No, I...

866
37:11.480 --> 37:12.000
Mom,

867
37:13.000 --> 37:14.280
I'm doing fine here.

868
37:29.680 --> 37:31.140
Let me take this call, Mom.

869
37:39.480 --> 37:40.360
Hello.

870
37:41.200 --> 37:43.000
When is your next rehab session?

871
37:43.800 --> 37:45.000
Wednesday. Why?

872
37:45.000 --> 37:46.880
Nothing, just checking in on you.

873
37:47.520 --> 37:49.520
How about I go with you on Wednesday?

874
37:49.920 --> 37:51.380
That's it. I'm hanging up.

875
37:51.440 --> 37:52.640
You're going with me?

876
38:05.720 --> 38:06.980
Drink the ginseng tea.

877
38:09.280 --> 38:10.940
It's arranged so neatly, Mom.

878
38:12.600 --> 38:13.800
Where is my computer?

879
38:13.800 --> 38:15.000
I put it in your bedroom.

880
38:15.000 --> 38:17.440
You can't just pile all these things

881
38:17.440 --> 38:18.570
on the dining table.

882
38:18.640 --> 38:18.920
Thanks, Mom.

883
38:18.920 --> 38:19.320
Drink.

884
38:20.080 --> 38:20.610
Drink up.

885
38:32.320 --> 38:32.920
Who is it?

886
38:32.920 --> 38:34.450
Your food delivery is here.

887
38:36.280 --> 38:38.400
Delivery? Who ordered delivery?

888
38:40.720 --> 38:41.720
Your delivery.

889
38:47.200 --> 38:47.800
What are you doing?

890
38:47.800 --> 38:49.600
Didn't you see a living person locked outside?

891
38:49.600 --> 38:50.800
Aren't you just the delivery?

892
38:50.800 --> 38:53.060
I am an inseparable part of the delivery.

893
38:56.920 --> 38:57.920
Drinking alone?

894
38:58.800 --> 39:00.200
Just because Xiaoxin isn't back,

895
39:00.200 --> 39:01.000
you can't just make do like this.

896
39:01.000 --> 39:02.920
Eating noodles with green onions.

897
39:02.920 --> 39:04.680
You're really something.

898
39:07.560 --> 39:09.760
Haven't had a drink in a few days, right?

899
39:10.400 --> 39:12.530
I get a big glass and you get a small cup?

900
39:13.600 --> 39:14.800
That's more like it.

901
39:15.560 --> 39:16.280
After this glass,

902
39:16.280 --> 39:18.010
we're officially reconciled.

903
39:18.600 --> 39:19.440
What reconciliation?

904
39:19.440 --> 39:21.370
You're forcing a reconciliation.

905
39:22.160 --> 39:22.800
You...

906
39:23.400 --> 39:25.880
I saw you sneak into my live stream.

907
39:25.880 --> 39:27.280
I didn't go into your live stream.

908
39:27.280 --> 39:28.920
But in your live stream,

909
39:28.920 --> 39:30.280
just talk about your own stuff.

910
39:30.280 --> 39:31.280
Don't drag me into it.

911
39:31.280 --> 39:32.610
Look at you. Look at you.

912
39:32.680 --> 39:33.200
You said you didn't.

913
39:33.200 --> 39:33.800
You saw it all.

914
39:33.800 --> 39:36.200
And you still say you didn't go into the live stream.

915
39:36.200 --> 39:38.060
I was just warning you in advance,

916
39:38.080 --> 39:39.280
to nip it in the bud.

917
39:39.280 --> 39:40.440
I know you too well.

918
39:40.440 --> 39:41.640
When you pass away,

919
39:41.640 --> 39:44.000
when you're cremated, your mouth

920
39:44.000 --> 39:45.560
will have to be taken out and burned separately.

921
39:45.560 --> 39:46.400
It's too stubborn.

922
39:46.400 --> 39:49.400
When you're cremated, your mouth

923
39:49.720 --> 39:50.800
will have to be put in a separate box.

924
39:50.800 --> 39:51.560
Why is that?

925
39:51.560 --> 39:52.490
It's too chatty.

926
39:56.160 --> 39:58.220
How come you have time to visit today?

927
39:58.800 --> 39:59.560
It's nothing.

928
39:59.560 --> 40:01.920
I just came to see how he's recovering.

929
40:02.000 --> 40:03.960
Li Lv is really lucky

930
40:04.520 --> 40:06.650
to have someone care about him so much.

931
40:07.400 --> 40:07.920
Don't be nervous.

932
40:07.920 --> 40:08.560
Steady.

933
40:08.560 --> 40:10.040
Don't sprain it again.

934
40:10.040 --> 40:11.520
I won't. I'm fine.

935
40:12.800 --> 40:14.000
Don't push yourself.

936
40:16.400 --> 40:18.560
Zhao Jia got promoted recently.

937
40:19.080 --> 40:20.280
He must be very busy.

938
40:20.560 --> 40:21.420
Still the same.

939
40:22.280 --> 40:24.800
Always on business trips. I never see her.

940
40:24.920 --> 40:25.920
That won't do.

941
40:25.920 --> 40:27.400
You must miss her a lot.

942
40:27.960 --> 40:29.360
I'm used to it.

943
40:30.080 --> 40:32.000
Used to it? You can't get used to that.

944
40:32.000 --> 40:32.800
If you ask me,

945
40:33.160 --> 40:34.080
Zhao Jia shouldn't

946
40:34.080 --> 40:36.810
work all the time. She needs a work-life balance.

947
40:37.080 --> 40:39.610
Otherwise, Dr. Cheng will be so heartbroken.

948
40:41.640 --> 40:43.320
Change positions. Lie down.

949
40:48.480 --> 40:50.210
Let's go camping this weekend.

950
40:50.440 --> 40:51.760
I remember when you guys were dating,

951
40:51.760 --> 40:53.280
you loved camping, right?

952
40:53.600 --> 40:55.800
Do you still have all that gear?

953
40:56.480 --> 40:57.360
Camping?

954
40:58.320 --> 40:59.600
Zhao Jia doesn't have time.

955
40:59.600 --> 41:02.120
Come on, you can always make time.

956
41:02.120 --> 41:04.320
Don't worry about Zhao Jia. I'll handle her.

957
41:04.320 --> 41:05.050
How about it?

958
41:06.960 --> 41:07.820
What about you?

959
41:09.400 --> 41:11.660
What do you mean? Weren't you listening?

960
41:11.720 --> 41:12.400
Camping.

961
41:15.480 --> 41:16.610
That's more like it.

962
41:17.080 --> 41:18.760
Then it's settled.

963
41:18.760 --> 41:19.960
You two bring Nuannuan,

964
41:19.960 --> 41:20.920
and I'll bring him.

965
41:20.920 --> 41:22.920
The five of us will relive our youth.

966
41:29.680 --> 41:30.720
Come catch me!

967
41:30.960 --> 41:33.160
You two put the things there. I'll do it.

968
41:34.160 --> 41:36.200
Look who's here.

969
41:36.560 --> 41:37.440
Nuannuan.

970
41:37.440 --> 41:39.200
Little Nuannuan.

971
41:39.360 --> 41:40.920
Do you still remember who I am?

972
41:40.920 --> 41:41.720
I remember.

973
41:41.720 --> 41:44.160
Auntie is a good friend of Mom and Dad.

974
41:44.160 --> 41:45.280
An old classmate.

975
41:45.440 --> 41:46.560
Hello, Auntie.

976
41:46.600 --> 41:47.800
Hello, Uncle.

977
41:51.080 --> 41:51.920
Did I say something wrong?

978
41:51.920 --> 41:53.720
No, you said it perfectly.

979
41:53.720 --> 41:54.760
Auntie, Uncle.

980
41:54.760 --> 41:55.960
Are they a good match?

981
41:56.080 --> 41:56.800
They are.

982
41:56.800 --> 41:57.720
See?

983
41:57.880 --> 41:59.600
Children have sharp eyes.

984
42:01.920 --> 42:02.800
I'm pushing hard!

985
42:02.800 --> 42:03.720
Sit tight!

986
42:04.000 --> 42:05.280
Don't swing us off!

987
42:05.920 --> 42:08.560
We should take her out to play more often.

988
42:11.600 --> 42:12.320
Okay.

989
42:15.960 --> 42:16.960
In the past,

990
42:17.920 --> 42:18.780
it was my fault.

991
42:19.000 --> 42:20.530
I could never find the time.

992
42:21.080 --> 42:23.280
I'll make some adjustments from now on.

993
42:25.240 --> 42:25.920
It's fine.

994
42:27.400 --> 42:28.200
Uncle,

995
42:28.200 --> 42:29.600
I want to go take a look over there.

996
42:29.600 --> 42:30.320
Over there?

997
42:30.560 --> 42:31.090
Let's go.

998
42:37.480 --> 42:38.240
Mr. Wang.

999
42:38.720 --> 42:39.980
I'm not busy. Go ahead.

1000
42:41.840 --> 42:44.360
Aunt, these are the flowers Uncle gave you.

1001
42:44.360 --> 42:46.160
Flowers from Uncle?

1002
42:46.160 --> 42:49.090
Then I should thank Nuannuan for bringing them to me.

1003
42:52.720 --> 42:53.640
Uncle.

1004
42:54.040 --> 42:54.960
No need to be so polite.
